WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.800
Candidates drift quickly; bridge joints remain precise

2
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:09.600
Upstream lanes accelerate; validation advances at constant speed

3
00:00:09.600 --> 00:00:14.400
Supported paths pass; unsupported paths stop with a small ochre marker

4
00:00:14.400 --> 00:00:19.200
Evidence lines lock only after passing a gate

5
00:00:19.200 --> 00:00:24.000
The measured return path completes onto a thin indigo foundation
